n67\t        (WebCore::ScrollingCoordinator::absoluteEventTrackingRegions):\n68\t        (WebCore::ScrollingCoordinator::absoluteNonFastScrollableRegionForFrame): Deleted.\n69\t        (WebCore::ScrollingCoordinator::absoluteNonFastScrollableRegion): Deleted.\n70\t        I intentionally left the Wheel event with synchronous dispatch.\n71\t        This use case will need its own set of tests.\n72\t\n73\t        * page/scrolling/ScrollingCoordinator.h:\n74\t        (WebCore::ScrollingCoordinator::frameViewEventTrackingRegionsChanged):\n75\t        (WebCore::ScrollingCoordinator::frameViewNonFastScrollableRegionChanged): Deleted.\n76\t        * page/scrolling/ScrollingStateFrameScrollingNode.cpp:\n77\t        (WebCore::ScrollingStateFrameScrollingNode::ScrollingStateFrameScrollingNode):\n78\t        (WebCore::ScrollingStateFrameScrollingNode::setEventTrackingRegions):\n79\t        (WebCore::ScrollingStateFrameScrollingNode::dumpProperties):\n80\t        (WebCore::ScrollingStateFrameScrollingNode::setNonFastScrollableRegion): Deleted.\n81\t        * page/scrolling/ScrollingStateFrameScrollingNode.h:\n82\t        * page/scrolling/ScrollingTree.cpp:\n83\t        (WebCore::ScrollingTree::shouldHandleWheelEventSynchronously):\n84\t        (WebCore::ScrollingTree::commitNewTreeState):\n85\t        (WebCore::ScrollingTree::eventTrackingTypeForPoint):\n86\t        (WebCore::ScrollingTree::isPointInNonFastScrollableRegion): Deleted.\n87\t        * page/scrolling/ScrollingTree.h:\n88\t        * page/scrolling/mac/ScrollingCoordinatorMac.mm:\n89\t        (WebCore::ScrollingCoordinatorMac::scheduleTreeStateCommit):\n90\t        * platform/EventTrackingRegions.h: Added.\n91\t        (WebCore::EventTrackingRegions::isEmpty):\n92\t        (WebCore::EventTrackingRegions::trackingTypeForPoint):\n93\t        (WebCore::operator\u003d\u003d):\n94\t\n1\t2016-06-07  Alex Christensen  \u003cachristensen@webkit.org\u003e\t95\t2016-06-07  Alex Christensen  \u003cachristensen@webkit.org\u003e\